{"2734480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trade Tales", "steam_appid": 2734480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/a1a3eefe0d3d81d654d2eb89e2e52d1c.avif?t=1785442243\" width=616 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/007f8a1a4312be851adda1be21e345a9.avif?t=1785442243\" width=616 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Character Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your character with an extensive range of options — face, hair, underwear, clothing, accessories, jewelry, shoes, watches and even nails. Create a look that’s truly personal and unique.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/b68884e2a383a4b0188a113b305a2f2a.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/b68884e2a383a4b0188a113b305a2f2a.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/b68884e2a383a4b0188a113b305a2f2a.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm seasonal crops, fish in rivers and oceans, mine rare ores, and raise animals for essential goods. Trade and collect valuable materials needed for crafting, tool upgrades, production, and building your growing economy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open &amp; Build Your Own Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run different types of businesses such as a restaurant, clothing shop, bakery, electronics store, and more. Customize your storefront with signage, layout, furniture, and decorations to create your own unique brand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop keeping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock shelves, decorate your store, and serve customers. Balance inventory, meet demand, and make smart trades to grow your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation &amp; Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up factories to mass-produce goods from the resources you’ve gathered. Develop your own brands and distribute them through your shop or other businesses, increasing demand and growing your reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Business Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, unlock helpful upgrades, and automate your workflow. Grow from a small shop into a bustling business, so your day can be spent on the things that truly matter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel and Leisure:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to different distant cities. Explore new places, meet new people, gain knowledge, and discover new business possibilities, adding a dynamic and enriching dimension to your gameplay. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Story, Your Way:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with nothing and rise through challenges to build a billion-dollar empire. Shape your character, start a family, grow your brand, and experience the journey from humble beginnings to extraordinary success. In <i>Trade Tales</i>, your story is yours to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/174816af52c5d3f236d48d80a04bb39e.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c