r essential goods. Trade and collect valuable materials needed for crafting, tool upgrades, production, and building your growing economy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/3a506cdab82b69658e1a672da017cfe9.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open &amp; Build Your Own Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run different types of businesses such as a restaurant, clothing shop, bakery, electronics store, and more. Customize your storefront with signage, layout, furniture, and decorations to create your own unique brand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/7e0bf14eec3db44a1a686c73f814bfc5.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop keeping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock shelves, decorate your store, and serve customers. Balance inventory, meet demand, and make smart trades to grow your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/c7573f2ee9c0285fb6de0dedcdf1702c.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation &amp; Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up factories to mass-produce goods from the resources you’ve gathered. Develop your own brands and distribute them through your shop or other businesses, increasing demand and growing your reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/0dfde1f0a74cfbcc1463ed22af20b9df.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Business Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, unlock helpful upgrades, and automate your workflow. Grow from a small shop into a bustling business, so your day can be spent on the things that truly matter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5a60ceb9a3fd24aa270dc5e05bcd53b5.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel and Leisure:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to different distant cities. Explore new places, meet new people, gain knowledge, and discover new business possibilities, adding a dynamic and enriching dimension to your gameplay. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.poster.avif?t=1785442243\" width=608 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.webm?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734480/extras/5244c5b2e94a17ffb063f5a7c2e76339.mp4?t=1785442243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Story, Your Way:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with nothing and rise through challenges to build a billion-dollar empire. Shape your character, start a family, grow your brand, and experience the journey from humble beginnings to extraordinary success. In <i>Trade Tales</i>, your story is yours to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com